- `space_template()`: Read space permit template JSON
- `app_dir(name)`: Get path to sample app directory
- `wait_for_layer_data()`: Poll until layer has non-empty data
- `wait_for_app_files()`: Poll until app files sync
- Constants: `MOCK_TIMEOUT` (500ms), `PAGE_SYNC_TIMEOUT` (10s)

**`tracer.rs`** - Protocol message tracing
- `Tracer`: Collects courier messages for debugging
- Assertions: `.assert_sequence()`, `.assert_contains_sequence()`, `.assert_count()`
- `.format_trace()`: Human-readable message log with timestamps

